Package: myvoice
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-venv, python3-pip, python3-dev, python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, libgirepository1.0-dev, gir1.2-notify-0.7, python3-pyatspi, at-spi2-core, portaudio19-dev, libportaudio2, xdotool, libcairo2-dev, pkg-config, gir1.2-ayatanaappindicator3-0.1 | gir1.2-appindicator3-0.1
Maintainer: MyVoice <myvoice@blue-water0.dev>
Description: Privacy-first local voice dictation
 MyVoice is a privacy-first, system-wide local voice dictation app for
 Linux Mint (Cinnamon, X11). Speech is transcribed entirely on-device
 using faster-whisper; no audio or transcript ever leaves the machine.
 .
 On first install, an internet connection is required so that Python
 dependencies (faster-whisper, numpy, etc.) can be downloaded. Speech
 model weights are downloaded separately, on first use of the app.
